1️⃣ First: clarify one key concept (very important)

👉 Storage growth ≠ data loss (RPO)

Storage growth over time → capacity planning, cost, trend analysis

Data loss during regional failover → RPO (Recovery Point Objective)

They are related, but not the same metric.

Aurora Global DB replicates asynchronously, so:

During a region failure, you may lose data that was written but not yet replicated

That loss is time-based, not size-based




